\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl276\slmult1\qj\fs28 GPT (Generative Pre-trained Transformer)\par
\f1\lang1049 }}\f0\lang16393\par
\ulnone\b0\fs24 GPT is a family of Large Language Models (LLMs) developed by OpenAI. It is based on the Transformer architecture and is designed to understand and generate human-like text. GPT is trained on massive amounts of text data and learns patterns, grammar, context, and reasoning abilities from the training data.\par
GPT operates in three main stages:\par

\pard 
{\listtext\f0 1.\tab}\jclisttab\tx360\ls1\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl276\slmult1\qj\b Pre-training\b0\par

\pard 
{\listtext\f0\u10625?\tab}\jclisttab\tx360\ls1\ilvl1\widctlpar\fi-360\li1440\sa160\sl276\slmult1\qj Trained on large text datasets.\par
{\listtext\f0 1\tab}Learns language patterns and context.\par

\pard 
{\listtext\f0 2.\tab}\jclisttab\tx360\ls1\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl276\slmult1\qj\b Fine-tuning\b0\par

\pard 
{\listtext\f0\u10625?\tab}\jclisttab\tx360\ls1\ilvl1\widctlpar\fi-360\li1440\sa160\sl276\slmult1\qj Further trained on task-specific data.\par
{\listtext\f0 1\tab}Improves performance for specialized domains.\par

\pard 
{\listtext\f0 3.\tab}\jclisttab\tx360\ls1\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl276\slmult1\qj\b Text Generation\b0\par

\pard 
{\listtext\f0\u10625?\tab}\jclisttab\tx360\ls1\ilvl1\widctlpar\fi-360\li1440\sa160\sl276\slmult1\qj Predicts the next most likely word in a sequence.\par
{\listtext\f0 1\tab}Generates coherent responses based on user prompts.\par

